                    {
                      "component": {
                        "name": "markdown-card",
                        "settings": {
                          "cardId": "csv1mfdzo",
                          "schemaVersion": 2.1,
                          "markdown": "<h1 style=\"font-family: &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;; color: rgb(128, 128, 128); font-size: var(--font-size-h1); text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Explore Rhode Island's New Legislative Districts</span></h1><h1 style=\"font-family: &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;; color: rgb(128, 128, 128); font-size: var(--font-size-h1); text-align: center;\"></h1><h6 style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"background-color: initial;\"><font color=\"#808080\">On August 12, 2021, the US Census Bureau released the 2020 Decennial Redistricting Census Data. In September 2021, Rhode Island began its state-level redistricting process, which created new Congressional, House, and Senate legislative districts. On February 15, 2022, the Rhode Island General Assembly voted to approve the finalized updated versions of the districts and Governor McKee signed the bill on February&nbsp;16, 2022.&nbsp;</font></span><span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128); font-family: &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;; font-size: var(--font-size-h6); background-color: initial;\">Once the bill was signed, Rhode Island’s 39 cities and towns\nredrew their wards, districts, and voting precincts lines. All 39 municipalities' data was\nupdated in Rhode Island's Centralized Voter Registration System by the end of June 2022.&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128); font-family: &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;; font-size: var(--font-size-h6); text-align: left;\"><br></div><div style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128); font-family: &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;; font-size: var(--font-size-h6); text-align: left;\"><span style=\"background-color: initial; font-size: var(--font-size-h6);\">Download all of the RI Legislative District Maps&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: initial; font-size: var(--font-size-h6);\">pdfs at one time:</span></div><ul style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128); font-family: &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;; font-size: var(--font-size-h6);\"><li style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://vote.sos.ri.gov/Forms/elections/DistrictInformation/staterepsmaps.zip\" target=\"_blank\">All 75 House District Map pdfs</a></li><li style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://vote.sos.ri.gov/Forms/elections/DistrictInformation/statesenmaps.zip\" target=\"_blank\">All 38 Senate District Map pdfs</a></li></ul><p style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128); font-family: &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;; font-size: var(--font-size-h6); text-align: left;\"><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: inherit; font-family: var(--fontsHeadingFamily),Avenir Next; font-size: var(--font-size-h6);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128); font-family: &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;; font-size: var(--font-size-h6); text-align: left;\"><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: inherit; font-family: var(--fontsHeadingFamily),Avenir Next; font-size: var(--font-size-h6);\">Download individual Legislative District maps by using the&nbsp;dashboard below. You can download singular districts or you can download a municipality to see all the districts within that city or town.&nbsp;</span><br></p><p style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128); font-family: &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;; font-size: var(--font-size-h6); text-align: left;\"><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: currentcolor; font-family: var(--fontsBaseFamily),Avenir Next; font-size: var(--font-size-h6);\">How to use the Dashboard<i>:</i></span></p><div style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128); font-family: &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;; font-size: var(--font-size-h6); text-align: left;\"><ul><li style=\"text-align: left; margin-top: 0.25em; line-height: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: none; height: initial;\">Use the selector tools on the far left to filter the tables and map. Please note that the selectors will not appear on the mobile version.</li><li style=\"text-align: left; margin-top: 0.25em; line-height: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: none; height: initial;\">Scroll through and click on the tables on the right to download an individual pdf. It will open on a new tab.&nbsp;</li><li style=\"text-align: left; margin-top: 0.25em; line-height: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: none; height: initial;\"><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: currentcolor; font-family: var(--fontsBaseFamily),Avenir Next;\">Open the map legend by clicking&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ristate.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/28c6ac559fc849c5946c65d1d396b45d/data\" style=\"background-color: initial; color: currentcolor; font-family: var(--fontsBaseFamily),Avenir Next; max-width: 100%; height: 26px; line-height: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; width: 25px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: initial; color: currentcolor; font-family: var(--fontsBaseFamily),Avenir Next;\">&nbsp;in the top right corner of the map to display what the colors represent.</span></li><li style=\"text-align: left; margin-top: 0.25em; line-height: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: none; height: initial;\"><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: currentcolor; font-family: var(--fontsBaseFamily),Avenir Next;\">Open the layers button&nbsp;</span><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ristate.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/0b258ef654ad4d05bf5c80a81660a084/data\" style=\"background-color: initial; color: currentcolor; font-family: var(--fontsBaseFamily),Avenir Next; max-width: 100%; height: 26px; line-height: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; width: 25px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: initial; color: currentcolor; font-family: var(--fontsBaseFamily),Avenir Next;\">&nbsp;in the top right corner and click on the \"eye\" icon to display or remove each of the district outlines. You can turn on Voting Precincts here.&nbsp;</span></li><li style=\"text-align: left; margin-top: 0.25em; line-height: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: none; height: initial;\"><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: currentcolor; font-family: var(--fontsBaseFamily),Avenir Next;\">On the mobile version use the arrows to scroll though different selector tables.</span></li></ul></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;; font-size: var(--font-size-h6); text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128);\">Visit Rhode Island's Voter Information Center&nbsp;</span><font color=\"#808080\">to learn more about elections and voting, </font><a href=\"https://vote.sos.ri.gov/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128);\">vote.ri.gov.</a><font color=\"#808080\">&nbsp;</font></div></h6>"
                        }
                      },
