                      "component": {
                        "name": "markdown-card",
                        "settings": {
                          "schemaVersion": 2.1,
                          "markdown": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Site created by the</p><h5 style=\"font-family: &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: var(--font-size-h5); text-align: center;\">Rhode Island Department of State | Secretary of State Gregg M. Amore</h5><p><em><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Data Sources:</span></em>&nbsp;RI Department of State, Rhode Island General Assembly,&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: initial; color: currentcolor; font-family: var(--fontsBaseFamily),Avenir Next;\">Rhode Island Municipalities &amp; Election Data Services</span></p><p><em><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Shapefile Sources:</span>&nbsp;</em>RI General Assembly and Election Data Services; US Bureau of the Census. </p><p>Want to download the shapefiles to make your own maps?&nbsp;</p><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.rigis.org/datasets/house-districts-2022/explore\" target=\"_blank\">House Districts Shapefile</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.rigis.org/datasets/senate-districts-2022/explore\" target=\"_blank\">Senate Districts Shapefile</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.rigis.org/datasets/e01ba5975c9e4069ab8e7cf642a0ec6d_0/explore\" target=\"_blank\">Congressional Districts Shapefile</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.rigis.org/datasets/edc::voting-precincts-2022/about\" target=\"_blank\">Rhode Island Voting Precincts</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www2.census.gov/geo/tiger/TIGER2020PL/STATE/44_RHODE_ISLAND/44/tl_2020_44_cousub20.zip\" target=\"_blank\">Rhode Island Municipalities (Census County Subdivisions)</a><br></li></ul><p><em><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Further Reading:</span></em><br></p><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.sos.ri.gov/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration-line: none;\">https://www.sos.ri.gov/</a></li><li><a href=\"https://vote.sos.ri.gov/\" target=\"_blank\">https://vote.sos.ri.gov/&nbsp;</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.rigis.org/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.rigis.org/</a></li></ul>"
                        }
